# The BA prototype under design-reference/ is a COMPLETE Nx workspace of its own
# (it has its own nx.json and an apps/cordele-web with the same project name as
# production). Without this, Nx finds two projects called `cordele-web` and
# refuses to build the project graph at all — every nx command fails, not just
# e2e. The prototype is a read-only visual reference (D-484/D-493): screens are
# promoted OUT of it into libs/<module>/, it is never built by this workspace.
design-reference/
